codex
I confirmed two wiring bugs and a false-PASS risk. Receiver ranks are computable from the saved pbp but never reach the manifests. The MISSING coverage and time-to-throw blocks use the wrong provenance keys; simply renaming them would let the gate accept their timestamps without checking whether values exist. I’ll normalize the keys and add explicit leg gaps so those missing inputs still block a pass.

Henry’s 69/85 carry share is correct for the last four BAL games, but only one was led by Fagnano. I’ll use the current-QB window required by the existing helper and preserve the four-game figure as historical context.
